  "solution_ref": "$f(x)=-x$ → $x=0$만. $g(x)=-7x$ ($x<0$), $h(x)=x^3-9x^2+15x$ ($x\\ge0$). $h$: 극댓값 $h(1)=7$, 극솟값 $h(5)=-25$. 교점 4개 → $0<k<7$. 합 $21$",
